# Only required on Node 21.x, which is EOL and rejected by the engines field of
# some transitive dependencies (minimatch declares "18 || 20 || >=22").
#
# On the version in .nvmrc (20.20.2) `yarn install` succeeds without this file —
# delete it once the project is off Node 21.
--install.ignore-engines true
--add.ignore-engines true
